### Frontend build output ###
# `npm run build` writes the compiled React app here so `mvn package` bundles it into the jar.
# It is generated, so it stays out of git: committing a minified bundle guarantees merge
# conflicts every time two people touch the frontend. Build before packaging - see DEPLOY.md.
